{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29703","headline":"奉和太原公送前杨秀才戴兼招杨正字戎 · 李商隐","name":"奉和太原公送前杨秀才戴兼招杨正字戎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潼关地接古弘农，万里高飞雁与鸿。\n桂树一枝当白日，芸香三代继清风。\n仙舟尚惜乖双美，彩服何由得尽同。\n谁惮士龙多笑疾，美髭终类晋司空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}